{"id":"630199","name":"梅干菜鲜肉包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630199/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"梅干菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鲜肉糜","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"自己晒的梅干菜，洗一下，浸泡。","img":"images/630199/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"温水里放酵母溶化。","img":"images/630199/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放面粉。","img":"images/630199/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/630199/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放温暖处发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/630199/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉糜里放葱姜。","img":"images/630199/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放食盐、鸡精、生抽和食用油。","img":"images/630199/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀再放点猪油。","img":"images/630199/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/630199/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"提前泡好的梅干菜，煮一下，捞出切末。","img":"images/630199/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放肉馅里拌匀。","img":"images/630199/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"发好的面取出来揉光排气。","img":"images/630199/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"分成剂子。","img":"images/630199/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/630199/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包包子。","img":"images/630199/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"全部包好，二次发酵。","img":"images/630199/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"发好的包子入蒸锅，大火烧开，改中小火蒸20分钟，焖5分钟即可。","img":"images/630199/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/630199/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}